.output

# Raw run artifacts are not repository structure. A TRX or a collected broker log belongs to one run;
# what is kept is the category summary that names its counters, and where a raw file mattered, its
# digest in evidence/RAW_RUN_ARTIFACT_MANIFEST.json. A run still writes them - the counters are parsed
# out of them - but under artifacts/, which is ignored above. policy_validator.py rejects one that
# reaches evidence/, so these two lines are convenience and that check is the guard.
*.trx
evidence/**/*.log
